# No environment variables are required locally.
#
# Each site reads its public URL, navigation, and homepage copy from
# apps/<site>/content/site/*.json. Those files are managed through
# GitCMS Settings, not through environment variables.
#
# On xCloud, set these values in the site's Environment editor. The start
# command listens on port 3000, so the Application Port and PORT must match.
#
# PORT=3000
# NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1
